    <string name="auth_intro_1_title_ja" translatable="false" formatted="false">一度話せば、全員に伝わる</string>
    <string name="auth_intro_1_title_en" translatable="false" formatted="false">Say it once. Everyone understands.</string>
    <string name="auth_intro_1_body_ja" translatable="false" formatted="false">職長の言葉を、やさしい日本語と英語に。本当にわかったかも、一人ずつ確認できます。</string>
    <string name="auth_intro_1_body_en" translatable="false" formatted="false">The foreman\'s words in plain Japanese and English, with a check that each worker really understood.</string>
    <string name="auth_intro_1_say_ja" translatable="false" formatted="false">金型交換の前に、必ず電源を切ってください。</string>
    <string name="auth_intro_1_say_en" translatable="false" formatted="false">Always switch the power off before a die change.</string>
    <string name="auth_intro_1_ok_ja" translatable="false" formatted="false">わかった</string>
    <string name="auth_intro_1_ok_en" translatable="false" formatted="false">Understood</string>
    <string name="auth_intro_2_title_ja" translatable="false" formatted="false">現場の課題、第1位</string>
    <string name="auth_intro_2_title_en" translatable="false" formatted="false">The top problem on the floor</string>
    <string name="auth_intro_2_stat_ja" translatable="false" formatted="false">「日本語能力等のためにコミュニケーションが取りにくい」</string>
    <string name="auth_intro_2_stat_en" translatable="false" formatted="false">say communication is hard because of Japanese ability</string>
    <string name="auth_intro_2_body_ja" translatable="false" formatted="false">外国人を雇う事業所で最も多い回答です（前年43.9%）。伝わらない指示は、安全のリスクです。</string>
    <string name="auth_intro_2_body_en" translatable="false" formatted="false">The most-cited problem among employers of foreign workers (43.9% the year before). An instruction not understood is a safety risk.</string>
    <string name="auth_intro_2_src_ja" translatable="false" formatted="false">厚生労働省 2025年 外国人雇用実態調査</string>
    <string name="auth_intro_2_src_en" translatable="false" formatted="false">MHLW 2025 survey of foreign employment</string>
    <string name="auth_intro_3_title_ja" translatable="false" formatted="false">理解は、確認する</string>
    <string name="auth_intro_3_title_en" translatable="false" formatted="false">Understanding is checked, not assumed</string>
    <string name="auth_intro_3_s1_ja" translatable="false" formatted="false">職長が話す・入力する</string>
    <string name="auth_intro_3_s1_en" translatable="false" formatted="false">The foreman speaks or types</string>
    <string name="auth_intro_3_s2_ja" translatable="false" formatted="false">AIが確認質問を1〜3問つくる</string>
    <string name="auth_intro_3_s2_en" translatable="false" formatted="false">AI writes 1–3 quick questions</string>
    <string name="auth_intro_3_s3_ja" translatable="false" formatted="false">一人ずつ 緑・オレンジ・赤</string>
    <string name="auth_intro_3_s3_en" translatable="false" formatted="false">Green, orange or red for each worker</string>
    <string name="auth_intro_3_body_ja" translatable="false" formatted="false">わからなかった人には、その人だけにやさしく再説明。確認に合格するまで機械はロック。</string>
    <string name="auth_intro_3_body_en" translatable="false" formatted="false">A worker who missed it gets a simpler re-explanation. A machine unlocks only after its Check is passed.</string>
    <string name="auth_intro_4_title_ja" translatable="false" formatted="false">家でも、まちでも</string>
    <string name="auth_intro_4_title_en" translatable="false" formatted="false">At home and in town</string>
